  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Water Provision Response in Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NRC will continue emergency water trucking to an estimated 62,500 conflict-affected individuals across 26 displacement sites (15 in North Gaza, 11 in South), delivering 6 litres of safe water per person per day in line with WASH Cluster standards &#x2013; totalling 17,200 cubic metres over the intervention period.</narrative>
